Mechanical Power Transmission Apparatus</RTL><BRK/><BRK/></REF><REF><ORG>UL SOLUTIONS (UL)</ORG><BRK/><BRK/><RID>UL 778</RID><RTL>(2016; Reprint Jul 2024) UL Standard for Safety Motor-Operated Water Pumps</RTL><BRK/><BRK/></REF></SPT><SPT><TTL>SUBMITTALS</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
